{
  "version": "Notebook/1.0",
  "items": [
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "![the bank](https://pustaka.example.com/public-assets/logo.svg) &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; **Powered by Azure Arc and Azure Monitor** &nbsp;&nbsp; ![Microsoft](https://aadcdn.msftauth.net/shared/1.0/content/images/microsoft_logo_564db913a7fa0ca42727161c6d031bef.svg)"
      },
      "name": "brand-header"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "name": "la-intro",
      "content": {
        "json": "## Look-ahead: what will need attention next\nOne risk register for the MiniBank lab from four lenses: **Capacity** (trend to the limit), **Calendar** (dates that expire), **Posture** (known weaknesses) and **Service** (error budget and speed trend of the business transactions). **Act** = breaks within 7 days, or would break if one part fails; **Watch** = within 30 days, or a known weakness; **Planned** = known and accepted; **OK** = nothing in sight; **Info** = context. History starts 13 Nov 2026 14:00 WIB and lab drills are left out of every trend. The board shows the risks; it fixes nothing. Sources: KQL functions in law-appmon (MiniBankLookahead, MiniBankLaReadings, MiniBankErrorBudget, MiniBankLaScore) and the read-only Look-ahead collector on HV-HOST-02 (hourly; dates and posture daily)."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "name": "la-tiles",
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "MiniBankLookahead()\n| summarize Risks = count() by Status\n| extend Rank = case(Status == 'Act', 1, Status == 'Watch', 2, Status == 'Planned', 3, Status == 'OK', 4, 5)\n| order by Rank asc\n| project Status, Risks",
        "size": 4,
        "title": "Risks by status",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "crossComponentResources": [
          "/subscriptions/<SUBSCRIPTION_ID>/resourceGroups/rg-appmon-openshift-demo/providers/Microsoft.OperationalInsights/workspaces/law-appmon"
        ],
        "visualization": "tiles",
        "tileSettings": {
          "titleContent": {
            "columnMatch": "Status",
            "formatter": 18,
            "formatOptions": {
              "thresholdsOptions": "colors",
              "thresholdsGrid": [
                {
                  "operator": "==",
                  "thresholdValue": "Act",
                  "representation": "redBright",
                  "text": "{0}{1}"
                },
                {
                  "operator": "==",
                  "thresholdValue": "Watch",
                  "representation": "orange",
                  "text": "{0}{1}"
                },
                {
                  "operator": "==",
                  "thresholdValue": "Planned",
                  "representation": "blue",
                  "text": "{0}{1}"
                },
                {
                  "operator": "==",
                  "thresholdValue": "OK",
                  "representation": "green",
                  "text": "{0}{1}"
                },
                {
                  "operator": "==",
                  "thresholdValue": "Hit",
                  "representation": "green",
                  "text": "{0}{1}"
                },
                {
                  "operator": "==",
                  "thresholdValue": "Miss",
                  "representation": "redBright",
                  "text": "{0}{1}"
                },
                {
                  "operator": "Default",
                  "thresholdValue": null,
                  "representation": null,
                  "text": "{0}{1}"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "leftContent": {
            "columnMatch": "Risks",
            "formatter": 12,
            "formatOptions": {
              "palette": "auto"
            }
          },
          "showBorder": true
        }
      }
    },
